      "summary": "build_01: Added the root CMake project for the repeated-tensor operator, scoped to Ascend910B and wiring host, kernel, and optional graph subdirectories.; build_02: Adds the isolated repeat operator build script with SoC validation, kernel/package verification, and explicitly gated UT/ST/example execution.; build_03: Defines the isolated Repeat host build, host libraries, ACLNN sources, and conditional CANN opapi linkage.; build_04: Added the op_kernel CMake build definition for the Repeat operator, targeting Ascend910B3/arch22.; host_01: Added the Repeat operator host definition with one float32 input, one float32 output, and required repeats/axis attributes.; host_02: Stage 6/17 host_02: added Repeat infer-shape for scalar repeats and axis normalization.; host_03: Generated host tiling for Repeat with strict float32 rank-2 axis-1 admission, shape-derived repeat factor, bounded rejection, and kernel-facing TilingData assignment.; kernel_01: Added the arch22 Repeat kernel entry that binds the registered tiling data to the Repeat kernel class.; kernel_02: Stage 9/17 kernel_02: complete arch22 Repeat kernel class header (float32, 2D axis-1 repeat, Init/CopyIn/Compute/CopyOut with explicit cross-pipe synchronization).; kernel_03: Defined the authoritative RepeatTilingData schema for the arch22 repeat kernel.; kernel_04: Added the arch22 Repeat tiling template-argument declaration, bounded to float32 and single-buffer operation.; api_01: Added the complete ACLNN L2 header for Repeat with the scalar repeats/axis contract and two-stage API declarations.; api_02: Added ACLNN L2 implementation for Repeat with explicit validation, contiguous handling, L0 dispatch, and ViewCopy output.; api_03: Stage 14/17 (api_03): emit the L0 ACLNN header declaring l0op::Repeat with the (self, repeats, axis, executor) contract shared by the L2 wrapper, infer-shape, tiling and kernel stages; float32-only, integer scalar repeats, non-negative normalized axis.; api_04: Implemented the bounded L0 ACLNN Repeat implementation for float32 rank-2 axis-1 scalar repeats, with validation, shape inference, executor allocation, and AI Core launch.; test_adapter_01: Adds complete NumPy-oracle repeat tests plus guarded public asnumpy.repeat adapter checks.; test_adapter_02: Emit the unverified AsNumpy adapter manifest for repeat with explicit public, pybind, native, kernel, and ACLNN symbol mappings plus bounded float32 support scope.",
